<title>USA: NYSE suspends Cincinnati Gas stock.</title>
<headline>NYSE suspends Cincinnati Gas stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Thursday that it is immediately suspending trading in Cincinnati Gas &amp; Electric Co stock and applying to delist the issues.</p>
<p>The NYSE said it normally considers suspending and delisting a company when fewer than 100,000 preferred shares are held by the public.</p>
<p>The announcement applies to cumulative preferred stock series 4 3/4 percent, series 7 3/8 percent and series 7 7/8 percent, the NYSE said.</p>
</text>
